---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What Pat on Sports and the Pat on Sports app collect, and how to request deletion."
  canonical="/privacy"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <p class="text-[11px] font-display font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-red mb-3">
      Privacy
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-wide text-navy">
      Privacy policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-navy-muted">
      Last updated: September 14, 2026
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg text-navy-muted font-serif">
      <p>
        Pat on Sports is a personal sports column at
        <a class="text-navy underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-red" href="https://patonsports.com"
          >patonsports.com</a
        >
        and companion mobile apps for iOS and Android. This page covers the
        website and the apps. It is written for readers and for App Store /
        Play Store review.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide text-navy pt-4">
        What we collect
      </h2>
      <p>By default, almost nothing.</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-navy font-sans font-semibold">Website.</strong>
          The site is static HTML. Pages do not require an account. Vercel may
          log standard request metadata (IP address, user agent, path) for
          hosting and abuse prevention. Vercel Analytics records anonymised
          page views.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-navy font-sans font-semibold">Comments.</strong>
          If you leave a comment, the name (and optional email) you enter is
          stored with that comment so the thread can show who wrote what. Email,
          when provided, is used only for moderation contact and is not shown
          publicly. Comment data currently lives with CommentBox.io; when
          first-party comments ship, it will live in a database we operate.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-navy font-sans font-semibold">App push
            notifications.</strong>
          If you opt in, the app registers an Expo push token so we can send one
          notification when a new post is published. The token is a device
          identifier used only for that purpose. It is not linked to your name
          or email.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide text-navy pt-4">
        What we do not collect
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>No accounts, sign-in, or paywalls.</li>
        <li>No advertising SDKs and no ad tracking.</li>
        <li>
          No third-party analytics SDK in the mobile apps (v1). The website uses
          Vercel Analytics only.
        </li>
        <li>No sale of personal data.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide text-navy pt-4">
        How we use it
      </h2>
      <p>
        Push tokens deliver new-post alerts you asked for. Comment fields display
        and moderate the thread. Hosting logs keep the site online and safe.
        Nothing else.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide text-navy pt-4">
        Retention and deletion
      </h2>
      <p>
        Push tokens are kept while notifications stay enabled and are removed
        when you opt out or when the push service reports the token as invalid.
        Comments remain with the post unless you ask for removal.
      </p>
      <p>
        To request deletion of a comment, a push token, or any other personal
        data we hold, email
        <a
          class="text-navy underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-red"
          href="mailto:pat@patonsports.com"
          >pat@patonsports.com</a
        >
        from the address you used (if any) and say what you want removed. I aim
        to respond within 5 business days.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide text-navy pt-4">
        Children
      </h2>
      <p>
        The site and app are general-audience sports commentary. They are not
        directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect data from
        children.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide text-navy pt-4">
        Changes
      </h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes in a material way, the date at the top of this
        page will update and, for app users, a short notice may appear via the
        app manifest banner.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide text-navy pt-4">
        Contact
      </h2>
      <p>
        Questions:
        <a
          class="text-navy underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-red"
          href="mailto:pat@patonsports.com"
          >pat@patonsports.com</a
        >
        ·
        <a class="text-navy underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-red" href="/support"
          >Support</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
